he Yalla API treats anything else as a parse error\n    67\t  and refuses to ech
o the offending content.\n    68\t- The backup agent\'s own credentials (the Pos
tgres role and the object-\n    69\t  storage key) are sourced from the operator
\'s secret store and are never\n    70\t  echoed by `--debug` or `--dry-run` inv
ocations.\n    71\t\n    72\tThese rules are enforced in code by `internal/contr
