al/controlplane/config`; tests cover absolute-\n   193\tpath validation, duratio
n parsing, the redacted projection, and the\n   194\tlog-safe log-value snapshot
.\n   195\t\n   196\t## Restore procedure\n   197\t\n   198\tThis is the **on-ca
ll** procedure. Treat every step as load-bearing — never\n   199\tskip a step to
