s`) and announce the\n   202\t   restore in `#yalla-ops` with the target restore
point and the affected\n   203\t   environment.\n   204\t2. **Freeze writes**: p
ause the worker fleet (`kubectl scale deploy\n   205\t   yalla-worker --replicas
=0`) and put the API into read-only mode\n   206\t   (`YALLA_READ_ONLY=1`, then 
