ord.\n   238\t11. **Close the incident** with the timeline (freeze → restore → s
moke →\n   239\t    cutover → resume) and the actual restore point reached. Sche
dule a\n   240\t    blameless review within five business days.\n   241\t\n   24
2\t## Rehearsal — required in staging every quarter\n   243\t\n   244\tA restore
that has never been rehearsed is a restore that does not work.\n   245\tEvery qu
arter (or before a major Postgres upgrade), Backend Operations runs\n   246\tthe
