res only into a throwaway\n   278\t`YALLA_REHEARSAL_DATABASE_URL`, runs `/usr/lo
cal/bin/yalla-api --migrate-only`\n   279\tagainst the restored database, execut
es the configured canary suite, and writes\n   280\ta redacted report only after
those steps pass.\n   281\t\n   282\t## What is NOT in scope\n   283\t\n   284\t
This runbook covers the control-plane database. It does **not** cover:\n   285\t
